# Final Showdown with all three modes ({W} + {1} + {1} + {3}{W}{W} = eight mana: Mox Pearl, a Black Lotus (WWW) and four more
# Moxen): the modes are followed in printed order (CR 700.2). First every creature loses all abilities, then Bot1 chooses its only
# creature, the Darksteel Myr, which gains indestructible after the loss (a later effect, CR 613.7, so it keeps it), then every
# creature is destroyed: Bot2's Ornithopter dies and the Myr survives.

